  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 206.03 Official Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 206.03 Official Notice.\n\n(a) The presiding officer shall take official notice pursuant to RSA 541-A:33, V.\n\n(b) The presiding officer shall state on the record the matters of which he/she intends to take official notice, and afford the parties the opportunity to object.\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec200.html"
